  <entry>
    <title>blog从Linux迁移至Windows</title>
    <url>/2026/08/24/blog%E4%BB%8ELinux%E8%BF%81%E7%A7%BB%E8%87%B3Windows/</url>
    <content><![CDATA[<h4 id="转移-Linux-上的-blog-项目到-Windows"><a href="#转移-Linux-上的-blog-项目到-Windows" class="headerlink" title="转移 Linux 上的 blog 项目到 Windows"></a>转移 Linux 上的 blog 项目到 Windows</h4><ol>
<li>初始化 Git<figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">git init</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>
<li>添加远程仓库<figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">git remote add origin git@github.com:用户名/仓库名.git</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>
<li>添加文件<figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">git add .</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>
<li>提交文件<figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">git commit -m <span class="string">&quot;初始提交&quot;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>
<li>推送文件到远程仓库<figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">git push -u origin 主分支名</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>
<li>在 Windows 上拉取备份的 blog 项目<figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">git <span class="built_in">clone</span> git@github.com:用户名/仓库名.git</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>
</ol>
<h4 id="配置-Windows-上的-blog-项目"><a href="#配置-Windows-上的-blog-项目" class="headerlink" title="配置 Windows 上的 blog 项目"></a>配置 Windows 上的 blog 项目</h4><ol>
<li>安装 <a href="https://nodejs.org/en/download">Node.js</a></li>
<li>验证 Node.js 安装<figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">node -v</span><br><span class="line">npm -v</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>
<li>安装 hexo<figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">npm install hexo-cli -g</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>
<li>验证 hexo 安装<figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">hexo -v</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>
<li>拉取 blog 主题，这里是 butterfly 主题<figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">git <span class="built_in">clone</span> -b master https://github.com/jerryc127/hexo-theme-butterfly.git themes/butterfly</span><br><span class="line">npm install hexo-renderer-pug hexo-renderer-stylus --save</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>
<li>安装依赖<figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">npm install</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>
<li>预览迁移后的 blog 项目<figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">hexo clean</span><br><span class="line">hexo generate</span><br><span class="line">hexo server</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
访问 <a href="http://localhost:4000/">http://localhost:4000</a> 即可查看迁移后的 blog 项目</li>
</ol>
]]></content>
      <categories>
        <category>技术文档</category>
      </categories>
      <tags>
        <tag>blog</tag>
        <tag>迁移</tag>
        <tag>Windows</tag>
        <tag>Linux</tag>
      </tags>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <title>butterfly功能扩展</title>
    <url>/2026/08/24/butterfly%E5%8A%9F%E8%83%BD%E6%89%A9%E5%B1%95/</url>
    <content><![CDATA[<h2 id="评论功能扩展"><a href="#评论功能扩展" class="headerlink" title="评论功能扩展"></a>评论功能扩展</h2><ol>
<li>解锁 GitHub 评论功能</li>
</ol>
<ul>
<li>进入对应仓库的设置页面</li>
<li>勾选 <code>Discussions</code> 选项</li>
<li>侧边栏选择 <code>GitHub Apps</code></li>
<li>安装 <code>giscus</code> 应用</li>
</ul>
<ol start="2">
<li>配置 <code>Giscus</code></li>
</ol>
<ul>
<li>访问 <a href="https://giscus.app/">Giscus</a> 官方网站</li>
<li>选择对应的语言</li>
<li>填入对应的仓库</li>
<li>映射关系选择第一个 <code>pathname</code></li>
<li>分类选择 <code>Announcement</code></li>
<li>其他选择默认即可，最后启用giscus下面会生成一个 <code>&lt;script&gt;</code> 标签</li>
<li>配置 <code>_config.butterfly.yml</code> 中的 <code>giscus</code> 配置信息<figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="attr">comments:</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">use:</span> <span class="string">Giscus</span>  <span class="comment"># 启用 Giscus 评论功能</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">text:</span> <span class="literal">true</span>   <span class="comment"># 启用文本评论</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">lazyload:</span> <span class="literal">true</span> <span class="comment"># 启用懒加载评论</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">count:</span> <span class="literal">false</span>   <span class="comment"># 启用评论数量统计</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">card_post_count:</span> <span class="literal">false</span> <span class="comment"># 启用卡片评论数量统计</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">giscus:</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">repo:</span> <span class="string">yourname/yourrepo</span> <span class="comment"># 填写script标签中的 data-repo 值</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">repo_id:</span> <span class="string">your_repo_id</span>   <span class="comment"># 填写script标签中的 data-repo-id 值</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">category_id:</span> <span class="string">your_category_id</span> <span class="comment"># 填写script标签中的 data-category-id 值</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">theme:</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="attr">light:</span> <span class="string">light</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="attr">dark:</span> <span class="string">dark</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">option:</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="attr">mapping:</span> <span class="string">pathname</span> <span class="comment"># 填写script标签中的 data-mapping 值</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="attr">strict:</span> <span class="number">0</span> <span class="comment"># 填写script标签中的 data-strict 值</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="attr">reactions-enabled:</span> <span class="number">1</span> <span class="comment"># 填写script标签中的 data-reactions-enabled 值</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="attr">emit-metadata:</span> <span class="number">0</span> <span class="comment"># 填写script标签中的 data-emit-metadata 值</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="attr">input-position:</span> <span class="string">bottom</span> <span class="comment"># 填写script标签中的 data-input-position 值</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="attr">lang:</span> <span class="string">zh-CN</span> <span class="comment"># 填写script标签中的 data-lang 值</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>
</ul>
<ol start="3">
<li>验证 Giscus 评论功能</li>
</ol>
<ul>
<li>访问博客</li>
<li>查看评论功能是否正常</li>
<li>如果正常，说明 Giscus 评论功能配置成功</li>
<li>如果不正常，说明 Giscus 评论功能配置失败</li>
</ul>
<h2 id="搜索功能扩展"><a href="#搜索功能扩展" class="headerlink" title="搜索功能扩展"></a>搜索功能扩展</h2><ol>
<li>安装搜索插件<figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">npm install hexo-generator-searchdb --save</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>
<li>配置 <code>_config.yml</code> ,在末尾加入以下内容<figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="attr">search:</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">path:</span> <span class="string">search.xml</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">field:</span> <span class="string">post</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">content:</span> <span class="literal">true</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">format:</span> <span class="string">html</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>
<li>配置 <code>_config.butterfly.yml</code><figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="attr">search:</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">use:</span> <span class="string">local_search</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">placeholder:</span> <span class="string">搜索</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">local_search:</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">preload:</span> <span class="literal">false</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">top_n_per_article:</span> <span class="number">1</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">unescape:</span> <span class="literal">false</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">CDN:</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>
<li>验证搜索功能</li>
</ol>
<ul>
<li>访问博客</li>
<li>查看搜索功能是否正常</li>
<li>如果正常，说明搜索功能配置成功</li>
<li>如果不正常，说明搜索功能配置失败</li>
</ul>
<h2 id="自定义美化"><a href="#自定义美化" class="headerlink" title="自定义美化"></a>自定义美化</h2><ol>
<li><code>source</code> 中新建 <code>css\custom.css</code> 文件和 <code>js\custom.js</code> 文件</li>
<li>配置 <code>_config.butterfly.yml</code><figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="attr">inject:</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">head:</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="bullet">-</span> <span class="string">&lt;link</span> <span class="string">rel=&quot;stylesheet&quot;</span> <span class="string">href=&quot;/css/custom.css&quot;&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">bottom:</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="bullet">-</span> <span class="string">&lt;script</span> <span class="string">src=&quot;/js/custom.js&quot;&gt;&lt;/script&gt;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>
<li>接下来就可以尝试在这两个文件中添加自定义的样式和脚本了</li>
</ol>
<h2 id="可能遇到的问题"><a href="#可能遇到的问题" class="headerlink" title="可能遇到的问题"></a>可能遇到的问题</h2><ol>
<li>评论功能或搜索功能配置失败<figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">hexo clean</span><br><span class="line">hexo g</span><br><span class="line">hexo s</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>
<li>搜索按钮点击后没有反应</li>
</ol>
<ul>
<li>严格检查两个配置文件的相关内容，可能是一些细节输入有误</li>
</ul>
]]></content>
