  <entry>
    <title>butterfly配置指南</title>
    <url>/2026/08/24/butterfly%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97/</url>
    <content><![CDATA[<h3 id="配置文件介绍"><a href="#配置文件介绍" class="headerlink" title="配置文件介绍"></a>配置文件介绍</h3><ul>
<li>butterfly 的配置文件一般在 <code>themes/butterfly/_config.yml</code> 中,但是一般情况下我们不直接修改这个文件,而是复制这个文件到根目录下,保存为 <code>_config.butterfly.yml</code> ,然后在 <code>_config.butterfly.yml</code> 中进行配置</li>
</ul>
<h3 id="blog-图片修改"><a href="#blog-图片修改" class="headerlink" title="blog 图片修改"></a>blog 图片修改</h3><ul>
<li>首页图片修改位置如下<figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 首页图片</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">index_image:</span> <span class="string">/img/example.png</span> <span class="comment"># /img/在source目录下</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>
<li>个人头像修改位置如下<figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 个人头像</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">avatar:</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">img:</span> <span class="string">/img/example.png</span>   <span class="comment"># example.png替换为自己的头像</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">effect:</span> <span class="literal">false</span>           <span class="comment"># 关闭头像效果</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>
<li>logo 修改位置如下<figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># logo</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">logo:</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">img:</span> <span class="string">/img/example.png</span>   <span class="comment"># example.png替换为自己的logo</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">effect:</span> <span class="literal">false</span>           <span class="comment"># 关闭logo效果</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>
<li>网站图标修改位置如下<figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 网站图标</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">favicon:</span> <span class="string">/img/favicon.png</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>
</ul>
<h3 id="blog-导航栏配置"><a href="#blog-导航栏配置" class="headerlink" title="blog 导航栏配置"></a>blog 导航栏配置</h3><ul>
<li>导航栏修改位置如下，不需要的可以用#注释掉<figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 导航栏</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">menu:</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="string">首页:</span> <span class="string">/</span> <span class="string">||</span> <span class="string">fas</span> <span class="string">fa-home</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="string">归档:</span> <span class="string">/archives/</span> <span class="string">||</span> <span class="string">fas</span> <span class="string">fa-archive</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="string">标签:</span> <span class="string">/tags/</span> <span class="string">||</span> <span class="string">fas</span> <span class="string">fa-tags</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="string">分类:</span> <span class="string">/categories/</span> <span class="string">||</span> <span class="string">fas</span> <span class="string">fa-folder-open</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="string">友链:</span> <span class="string">/link/</span> <span class="string">||</span> <span class="string">fas</span> <span class="string">fa-link</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="string">关于:</span> <span class="string">/about/</span> <span class="string">||</span> <span class="string">fas</span> <span class="string">fa-heart</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>
<li>如果导航栏里有 <code>标签</code> <code>分类</code> <code>友链</code> <code>关于</code> 这几个选项,则需要分别执行以下命令<figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">npx hexo new page tags</span><br><span class="line">npx hexo new page categories</span><br><span class="line">npx hexo new page <span class="built_in">link</span></span><br><span class="line">npx hexo new page about</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>
<li>命令执行后会在 <code>source</code> 目录下生成对应的页面文件夹及文件，分别替换以下文件里的内容<br><code>source/tags/index.md</code><figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="meta">---</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">title:</span> <span class="string">tags</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">date:</span> <span class="number">2026-08-23 02:35:32</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">type:</span> <span class="string">tags</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">comments:</span> <span class="literal">false</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="meta">---</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<code>source/categories/index.md</code><figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="meta">---</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">title:</span> <span class="string">categories</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">date:</span> <span class="number">2026-08-23 02:35:32</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">type:</span> <span class="string">categories</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">comments:</span> <span class="literal">false</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="meta">---</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<code>source/about/index.md</code> 页面可以自定义内容,例如添加个人介绍、联系邮箱等</li>
</ul>
<h3 id="侧边栏配置"><a href="#侧边栏配置" class="headerlink" title="侧边栏配置"></a>侧边栏配置</h3><ul>
<li>侧边栏修改位置如下，不需要的可以用#注释掉<figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="attr">aside:</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">enable:</span> <span class="literal">true</span>    <span class="comment"># 开启侧边栏</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">hide:</span> <span class="literal">false</span>     <span class="comment"># 隐藏侧边栏</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">button:</span> <span class="literal">true</span>    <span class="comment"># 显示侧边栏按钮</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">mobile:</span> <span class="literal">true</span>    <span class="comment"># 开启移动端侧边栏</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">position:</span> <span class="string">right</span> <span class="comment"># 侧边栏位置</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">display:</span>        <span class="comment"># 侧边栏显示内容</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">archive:</span> <span class="literal">true</span>   <span class="comment"># 显示归档</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">tag:</span> <span class="literal">true</span>       <span class="comment"># 显示标签</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">category:</span> <span class="literal">true</span>  <span class="comment"># 显示分类</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">card_author:</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="attr">enable:</span> <span class="literal">true</span>    <span class="comment"># 显示作者卡片</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="attr">button:</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="attr">enable:</span> <span class="literal">true</span>    <span class="comment"># 显示作者卡片按钮</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="attr">icon:</span> <span class="string">fab</span> <span class="string">fa-github</span>    <span class="comment"># 作者卡片按钮图标</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="attr">text:</span> <span class="string">Follow</span> <span class="string">Me</span>    <span class="comment"># 作者卡片按钮文本</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="attr">link:</span> <span class="string">https://www.example.com/</span>    <span class="comment"># 作者卡片按钮链接</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">card_announcement:</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="attr">enable:</span> <span class="literal">true</span>    <span class="comment"># 显示公告卡片</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="attr">content:</span> <span class="string">欢迎来到我的博客。</span>    <span class="comment"># 公告卡片内容</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">card_recent_post:</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="attr">enable:</span> <span class="literal">true</span>    <span class="comment"># 显示最近文章卡片</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">card_categories:</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="attr">enable:</span> <span class="literal">true</span>    <span class="comment"># 显示分类卡片</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">card_tags:</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="attr">enable:</span> <span class="literal">true</span>    <span class="comment"># 显示标签卡片</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">card_archives:</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="attr">enable:</span> <span class="literal">false</span>   <span class="comment"># 显示归档卡片</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>
</ul>
<h3 id="其他"><a href="#其他" class="headerlink" title="其他"></a>其他</h3><ul>
<li>单篇文章书写示例<figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="meta">---</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">title:</span> <span class="string">单篇文章书写示例</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">date:</span> <span class="number">2026-08-24 15:21:25</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">tags:</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="bullet">-</span> <span class="string">单篇文章</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="bullet">-</span> <span class="string">示例</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">categories:</span> <span class="string">技术文档</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">cover:</span> <span class="string">/img/example.png</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="meta">---</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>
</ul>
]]></content>
